1
00:00:34,877 --> 00:00:44,396
I spread a parasol to keep the heat out.

2
00:00:55,998 --> 00:01:07,346
The long-awaited Obon vacation has begun.

3
00:02:25,829 --> 00:02:35,414
I'm going to spend more time at home.
I bought some flowers.

4
00:03:27,893 --> 00:03:36,547
I'm going to take a break with a cup of buckwheat tea.

5
00:03:45,218 --> 00:03:53,572
Lovely manjuu buns, a souvenir of Shizuoka!

6
00:03:57,598 --> 00:04:06,584
A crunchy, cheery taste.

7
00:04:31,910 --> 00:04:39,832
I bought some cosmetics at the station's general store.

8
00:04:55,576 --> 00:05:05,527
Cool colors.
I bought it to use with my yukata.

9
00:05:26,787 --> 00:05:36,239
I was attracted by the word “beautiful nails”.

10
00:06:20,250 --> 00:06:28,937
It's hot, so I'm going to get ready for a bath.

11
00:06:58,032 --> 00:07:09,846
I want to put them in different places.
I'm going to put them up little by little.

12
00:07:44,619 --> 00:07:55,735
I bought this meat for a samgyeopsal party.

13
00:07:58,878 --> 00:08:10,459
Defrost the meat first.
I'm going to cook some rice.

14
00:08:39,010 --> 00:08:50,362
I chose the scent of the forest to relax.

15
00:09:25,748 --> 00:09:35,968
I chose a body soap with a strong scent because it's summer.

16
00:10:24,553 --> 00:10:30,248
I cook dinner.

17
00:11:21,110 --> 00:11:30,499
Plenty of cabbage.
Asakizuke with 1% salt, salted kelp and chili peppers.

18
00:11:42,774 --> 00:11:49,625
Salted cucumbers are frozen.

19
00:12:12,853 --> 00:12:19,732
I make a green onion salad that goes perfectly with samgyeopsal.

20
00:12:31,516 --> 00:12:40,000
I froze them as a block.
I grill them all.

21
00:13:24,428 --> 00:13:31,307
I make it spicy with gochujang (red pepper paste).

22
00:14:15,191 --> 00:14:21,394
A hot dish.

23
00:14:31,193 --> 00:14:37,198
I didn't have any ingredients.
I dug out some frozen edamame.

24
00:14:53,376 --> 00:15:02,737
It's ready to serve over microwaved tofu.

25
00:16:12,730 --> 00:17:03,337
I just received news of the birth of second baby.
The first child is becoming a big sister. I prepared a card to say 'Congratulations on becoming a big sister!' to her.

26
00:17:31,892 --> 00:17:38,834
Together with tea that brought Mom's face to mind when I tasted it.

27
00:17:45,564 --> 00:17:52,358
She says first child is a little jealous of the baby.

28
00:18:00,369 --> 00:18:08,715
Will the child remember her current feelings as an adult?
I don't remember what it was like to have a sister.🤭

29
00:18:26,248 --> 00:18:36,342
Another happy event in August!

30
00:18:49,205 --> 00:19:00,540
I'm going to make afogado which I saw on instagram with green tea ice cream and red bean paste.

31
00:19:22,941 --> 00:19:29,087
It's an unexpected combination, but it's delicious. 

32
00:20:04,878 --> 00:20:10,901
I hide the unevenness of the nails.

33
00:21:32,795 --> 00:21:40,041
I slept well and woke up slowly.

34
00:22:06,641 --> 00:22:12,336
Fried cabbage with a hint of curry.

35
00:22:20,420 --> 00:22:24,592
A little soy sauce.

36
00:22:49,589 --> 00:22:57,173
How to make hot dogs with sliced bread. 🤭

37
00:23:34,792 --> 00:23:39,330
Cold instant soup.

38
00:24:04,742 --> 00:24:12,608
Today's drink is hot coffee with extra hot water.

39
00:24:33,901 --> 00:24:41,965
Curry flavored cabbage was a nice addition.😋

40
00:25:20,373 --> 00:25:28,888
I was soaring this year, wondering if I would have a chance to wear a yukata.🤫

41
00:25:47,897 --> 00:25:57,540
With the help of the video,
I love the time I manage to spend dressing.

42
00:26:01,685 --> 00:26:09,043
I'm wondering about a few things here and there.
I'll let the dark night cheat me.😅

43
00:26:43,749 --> 00:26:51,418
Dancing and watching.
A good time for both.

44
00:27:01,984 --> 00:27:09,455
Come back for more if you need more syrup, said the shaved ice man.🍧
It was a festival with warm atmosphere.😊

45
00:27:28,105 --> 00:27:33,800
I found a nice restaurant nearby and went in.

46
00:27:41,727 --> 00:27:51,453
It was my first experience to dine surrounded by antiques.🔍
It was a wonderful time, both the space and the food!

47
00:29:03,983 --> 00:29:10,439
Before going to bed,
I'm a little hungry.

48
00:29:54,542 --> 00:29:59,334
Thank you for watching to the end

